  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Inserting an apparently innocuous triple such as:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -iXPUT --data-binary '<> <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://ex.org/p#123"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://ex.org/p#123",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://ex.org/res/abc"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://ex.org/res/abc",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> .' -H'Content-type:text/turtle' ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Returns an apparently successful response: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "HTTP/1.1 201 Created",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: Sun, 18 Mar 2018 02:14:17 GMT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "ETag: W/\"f2be3bf3552ed0f662c36cfe2f320c003d80fea0\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Last-Modified: Sun, 18 Mar 2018 02:14:17 GMT",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Location: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Content-Type: text/plain",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Content-Length: 40",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Server: Jetty(9.2.3.v20140905)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/test_blowup",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "But on GET, the server returns a 500 error: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java.lang.IllegalArgumentException: The localName argument may not be null or zero-length",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.common.util.CheckArg.isNotZeroLength(CheckArg.java:360)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.common.util.CheckArg.isNotEmpty(CheckArg.java:373)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.jcr.value.basic.NameValueFactory.create(NameValueFactory.java:175)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.jcr.value.basic.NameValueFactory.create(NameValueFactory.java:168)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.DocumentTranslator.getProperties(DocumentTranslator.java:245)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.LazyCachedNode.getProperties(LazyCachedNode.java:425)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "at org.modeshape.jcr.AbstractJcrNode.getProperties(AbstractJcrNode.java:2073)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "[...]",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The culprit seems to be the numeral in the predicate after the `#` sign. Whether that may be legal syntax or not (it seems to me, and other ttl parsers accept it), the aggravating factor is that the resource is created but unusable in any way (including DELETE). The server should instead return an error before persisting the content if it has a problem with it. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
